26:["$","div",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Rothenthurm is strategically located between Zug, Schwyz and Einsiedeln. The main road over the Sattel pass is open year-round. In emergencies we know detours via Biberbrugg or Sattel-Aegeri."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"In summer we organise transfers to popular hiking destinations like Sattel-Hochstuckli, the Mythen or Hoch-Ybrig. In winter we drive skiers also to Stoos, Engelberg or Hoch-Ybrig."}]]}]
